    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d647-a5">

                <pb facs="1117" n="1057" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg1057"/>


                <head>Mr. Sullivan to Mr.
                        Hanaberg.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Bogota,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-02-15"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 15, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Your dispatch of the 14th ultimo, with
                    inclosures, commenting on the report of he secretary general of the State of
                    Bolivar to the secretary for foreign relations of Colombia on the outrage and
                    murder committed on American citizens at Carthagena on the 1st of September
                    last, has been received.</p>
                <p>I have again to repeat my thanks for the vigilant and efficient manner in which
                    you have discharged your duty in this memorable matter, and the concise mode in
                    which you have carried out my intimation to you to give me your comments on the
                    testimony and result of these cases.</p>
                <p>I shall make use of your said dispatch and most valuable accompaniments in due
                    time.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your most obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>PETER J. SULLIVAN.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Aug.</hi> S. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Hanaberg,</hi> Esq., <hi rendition="#italic">United States Consul,
                            Carthagena.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
